# Doubt-Driven 鑑別工作台 (/ddx) — set these in Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Anthropic API key (console.anthropic.com). Never commit the real value.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Access code(s) the shared link carries as /ddx?k=<code>. Comma-separate to issue several.
DDX_ACCESS_KEY=
